    "question": {
      ":question/problem": "Let $S=UV.$ What is the value of ${s}_{11}$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$U=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -6\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$V=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & 5 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 6 & 1 \\\\ -6 & 5 & -3\\end{bmatrix}?$</div>\n</div>",
      ":question/worked-solution": "The full matrix product is\n\n$$\nS=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -3 & 0 \\\\ {\\color{lightgray}{0}} & {\\color{lightgray}{2}} & {\\color{lightgray}{-6}}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & {\\color{lightgray}{5}} & {\\color{lightgray}{0}} \\\\ -3 & {\\color{lightgray}{6}} & {\\color{lightgray}{1}} \\\\ -6 & {\\color{lightgray}{5}} & {\\color{lightgray}{-3}}\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the $1$st row in $U$ by the $1$st column in $V$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{s}_{11} & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -3 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ -3 \\\\ -6\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =3\\cdot (-5)+(-3)\\cdot (-3)+0\\cdot (-6) \\\\  & =-15+9+0 \\\\  & =-6.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
