    "question": {
      ":question/problem": "Let $K=MN.$ What is the value of ${k}_{11}$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$M=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -3 \\\\ -3 & -6\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$N=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & -5 & -3 \\\\ 1 & -6 & 4\\end{bmatrix}?$</div>\n</div>",
      ":question/worked-solution": "The full matrix product is\n\n$$\nK=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -3 \\\\ {\\color{lightgray}{-3}} & {\\color{lightgray}{-6}}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & {\\color{lightgray}{-5}} & {\\color{lightgray}{-3}} \\\\ 1 & {\\color{lightgray}{-6}} & {\\color{lightgray}{4}}\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the $1$st row in $M$ by the $1$st column in $N$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{k}_{11} & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =4\\cdot (-3)+(-3)\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =-12-3 \\\\  & =-15.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
