    "question": {
      ":question/problem": "Let $T=UV.$ What is the value of ${t}_{11}$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$U=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 5 & -4 \\\\ -1 & -6 & 5 \\\\ -3 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 6 & 6 & 6\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$V=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 & 3 \\\\ 4 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -6 & 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}?$</div>\n</div>",
      ":question/worked-solution": "The full matrix product is\n\n$$\nT=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 5 & -4 \\\\ {\\color{lightgray}{-1}} & {\\color{lightgray}{-6}} & {\\color{lightgray}{5}} \\\\ {\\color{lightgray}{-3}} & {\\color{lightgray}{-2}} & {\\color{lightgray}{4}} \\\\ {\\color{lightgray}{6}} & {\\color{lightgray}{6}} & {\\color{lightgray}{6}}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & {\\color{lightgray}{3}} & {\\color{lightgray}{3}} \\\\ 4 & {\\color{lightgray}{1}} & {\\color{lightgray}{1}} \\\\ -6 & {\\color{lightgray}{3}} & {\\color{lightgray}{1}}\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the $1$st row in $U$ by the $1$st column in $V$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{t}_{11} & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 5 & -4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -6\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =3\\cdot 1+5\\cdot 4+(-4)\\cdot (-6) \\\\  & =3+20+24 \\\\  & =47.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
