    "question": {
      ":question/problem": "Let $R=PQ.$ What is the value of ${r}_{53}$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$P=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 3 \\\\ -5 & -1 \\\\ -4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$Q=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -2 & -5 & -5 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 1 & 4 & -1 & 6\\end{bmatrix}?$</div>\n</div>",
      ":question/worked-solution": "The full matrix product is\n\n$$\nR=\\begin{bmatrix}{\\color{lightgray}{-2}} & {\\color{lightgray}{0}} \\\\ {\\color{lightgray}{4}} & {\\color{lightgray}{6}} \\\\ {\\color{lightgray}{2}} & {\\color{lightgray}{3}} \\\\ {\\color{lightgray}{-5}} & {\\color{lightgray}{-1}} \\\\ -4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}{\\color{lightgray}{5}} & {\\color{lightgray}{-2}} & -5 & {\\color{lightgray}{-5}} & {\\color{lightgray}{2}} \\\\ {\\color{lightgray}{4}} & {\\color{lightgray}{1}} & 4 & {\\color{lightgray}{-1}} & {\\color{lightgray}{6}}\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the $5$th row in $P$ by the $3$rd column in $Q$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{53} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =(-4)\\cdot (-5)+1\\cdot 4 \\\\  & =20+4 \\\\  & =24.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
