      ":question/problem": "Let $Z = XY$. What is the value of $z_{31}$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$X=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 6 & 0 \\\\ -3 & -1 & 3 \\\\ -3 & -3 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 0 & -2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$Y=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 6 & -6 \\\\ -6 & 3 & -4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n?",
      ":question/worked-solution": "The full matrix product is\n\n$$\nZ=\\begin{bmatrix}{\\color{lightgray}{6}} & {\\color{lightgray}{6}} & {\\color{lightgray}{0}} \\\\ {\\color{lightgray}{-3}} & {\\color{lightgray}{-1}} & {\\color{lightgray}{3}} \\\\ -3 & -3 & -1 \\\\ {\\color{lightgray}{3}} & {\\color{lightgray}{0}} & {\\color{lightgray}{-2}}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 & {\\color{lightgray}{-2}} & {\\color{lightgray}{2}} \\\\ 2 & {\\color{lightgray}{6}} & {\\color{lightgray}{-6}} \\\\ -6 & {\\color{lightgray}{3}} & {\\color{lightgray}{-4}}\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the $3$rd row in $X$ by the $1$st column in $Y$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{z}_{31} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & -3 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -6\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =(-3)\\cdot 2+(-3)\\cdot 2+(-1)\\cdot (-6) \\\\  & =-6-6+6 \\\\  & =-6.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
