      ":question/worked-solution": "The full matrix product is\n\n$$\nP=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 3 & 3 \\\\ {\\color{lightgray}{-4}} & {\\color{lightgray}{4}} & {\\color{lightgray}{5}} \\\\ {\\color{lightgray}{2}} & {\\color{lightgray}{-3}} & {\\color{lightgray}{4}}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 & {\\color{lightgray}{-1}} \\\\ 1 & {\\color{lightgray}{-5}} \\\\ 6 & {\\color{lightgray}{-5}}\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the $1$st row in $Q$ by the $1$st column in $R$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{p}_{11} & =\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 3 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =6(5)+3(1)+3(6) \\\\  & =30+3+18 \\\\  & =51.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
