    "question": {
      ":question/problem": "Let $Z=XY.$ What is the value of ${z}_{13}$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$X=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -6\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$Y=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 5 & -4 & -2 \\\\ 4 & -5 & -1 & 5\\end{bmatrix}?$</div>\n</div>\n\n${z}_{13}=$\n{{field-1}}",
      ":question/worked-solution": "The full matrix product is\n\n$$\nZ=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & 1 \\\\ {\\color{lightgray}{1}} & {\\color{lightgray}{-6}}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}{\\color{lightgray}{-2}} & {\\color{lightgray}{5}} & -4 & {\\color{lightgray}{-2}} \\\\ {\\color{lightgray}{4}} & {\\color{lightgray}{-5}} & -1 & {\\color{lightgray}{5}}\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the $1$st row in $X$ by the $3$rd column in $Y$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{z}_{13} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =(-6)(-4)+1(-1) \\\\  & =24-1 \\\\  & =23.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
