      ":question/worked-solution": "The full matrix product is\n\n$$\nL=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & 4 \\\\ {\\color{lightgray}{1}} & {\\color{lightgray}{1}}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}4 & {\\color{lightgray}{-3}} & {\\color{lightgray}{6}} \\\\ -1 & {\\color{lightgray}{4}} & {\\color{lightgray}{6}}\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the $1$st row in $M$ by the $1$st column in $N$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{l}_{11} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =(-5)\\cdot 4+4\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =-20-4 \\\\  & =-24.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
